---

<section class="section dev" id="developers">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="dev-grid">
			<div>
				<div class="section-head">
					<p class="eyebrow">Developer Experience</p>
					<h2>Define the assessment. Execute it. Get an explainable decision.</h2>
				</div>
				<p class="dev-lede">
					This is the whole developer loop: define the assessment, trigger it
					against a local engine, and read back a decision with structured
					reasons. Everything else — the providers, scoring, policy,
					evidence, and audit — happens inside Credora and is inspectable.
				</p>
				<ul class="dev-steps">
					<li>
						<strong>Define</strong> — reference an application and a policy
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Execute</strong> — Credora runs providers in order
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Decide</strong> — get APPROVE, REVIEW, or REJECT with reasons
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="dev-codes">
				<figure class="code-block">
					<figcaption class="code-caption">
						<span></span>POST /assessments
					</figcaption>
					<pre><code><span class="tk-p">$</span> curl -X POST <span class="tk-u">http://localhost:8080/assessments</span> \
  -H <span class="tk-s">"Content-Type: application/json"</span> \
  -d <span class="tk-s">'&#123;
    "application_id": "app-001",
    "policy": "personal-loan-v1"
  &#125;'</span></code></pre>
				</figure>

				<figure class="code-block">
					<figcaption class="code-caption"><span></span>200 OK</figcaption>
					<pre><code>&#123;
  <span class="tk-k">"decision"</span>: <span class="tk-s">"REJECT"</span>,
  <span class="tk-k">"reasons"</span>: [
    &#123;
      <span class="tk-k">"code"</span>: <span class="tk-s">"HIGH_DSR"</span>,
      <span class="tk-k">"value"</span>: <span class="tk-n">0.81</span>,
      <span class="tk-k">"threshold"</span>: <span class="tk-n">0.70</span>
    &#125;
  ],
  <span class="tk-k">"policy"</span>: <span class="tk-s">"personal-loan-v1"</span>
&#125;</code></pre>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.dev {
		background: var(--c-bg);
		color: var(--c-ink-dark);
		background-image:
			linear-gradient(rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
			linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
		background-size: 44px 44px;
	}

	.dev .eyebrow {
		display: none;
	}

	.dev .section-head h2 {
		color: var(--c-ink-dark);
	}

	.dev-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.dev-lede {
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--c-muted-dark);
		max-width: 40rem;
	}

	.dev-steps {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 2rem 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	.dev-steps li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--c-muted-dark);
	}

	.dev-steps li::before {
		content: '';
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		width: 0.5rem;
		height: 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--c-accent);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.dev-steps strong {
		color: var(--c-ink-dark);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-weight: 600;
		min-width: 4.5rem;
	}

	.dev-codes {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
		min-width: 0;
	}

	.code-caption {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-line-dark);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--c-muted-dark);
	}

	.code-caption span {
		width: 0.6rem;
		height: 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--c-accent);
		opacity: 0.85;
	}

	.tk-s {
		color: #a5d6a0;
	}

	.tk-k {
		color: #8cc3ff;
	}

	.tk-n {
		color: #f2c46d;
	}

	.tk-p {
		color: var(--c-accent);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.tk-u {
		color: var(--c-muted-dark);
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.dev-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>